- **`src/`**: Source code directory
  - **`components/`**: Reusable React components
    - **`common/`**: Common UI components (buttons, inputs, cards, etc.)
    - **`layout/`**: Layout components (header, sidebar, footer)
    - **`features/`**: Feature-specific components
  - **`pages/`**: Page components mapped to routes
    - **`Dashboard/`**: Analytics and metrics dashboard
    - **`Orders/`**: Order management pages
    - **`Customers/`**: Customer management pages
    - **`Delivery/`**: Delivery staff management pages
    - **`Services/`**: Service catalog management
    - **`Reports/`**: Reporting and analytics pages
  - **`hooks/`**: Custom React hooks
  - **`services/`**: API client services
  - **`store/`**: State management (Context API or Redux)
  - **`utils/`**: Utility functions
  - **`types/`**: TypeScript type definitions
  - **`constants/`**: Application constants
  - **`assets/`**: Static assets (images, fonts, etc.)
  - **`styles/`**: Global styles and themes

